5847	5984	5809	5809	I	30	" My cabby drove fast . I do n't think I ever drove faster , but the others were there before us . The cab and the landau with their steaming horses were in front of the door when I arrived . I paid the man and hurried into the church . There was not a soul there save the two whom I had followed and a surpliced clergyman , who seemed to be expostulating with them . They were all three standing in a knot in front of the altar . I lounged up the side aisle like any other idler who has dropped into a church . Suddenly , to my surprise , the three at the altar faced round to me , and Godfrey Norton came running as hard as he could towards me .
